# Third-party material

## Google Material Symbols

Source: [Material Symbols Rounded at 27e9ef1dbeedc13d682fece4a58e1eda4cb0961a](https://github.com/google/material-design-icons/tree/27e9ef1dbeedc13d682fece4a58e1eda4cb0961a/symbols/android)

Each vector is adapted by removing the Android theme-attribute tint so its
consumer supplies the color, and adding a provenance comment. The paths,
dimensions, and upstream automatic mirroring are unchanged.

- `app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_arrow_back.xml`: adapted from [arrow_back](https://github.com/google/material-design-icons/blob/27e9ef1dbeedc13d682fece4a58e1eda4cb0961a/symbols/android/arrow_back/materialsymbolsrounded/arrow_back_24px.xml).
