## Moonshine Medium model and streaming policy

Source: [Moonshine Medium model and streaming policy](https://github.com/moonshine-ai/moonshine/tree/234f60faa0eb388b01cdf7e60aca232af37aefda)
License: MIT (English streaming model and reused source).

The bundled `medium-streaming-en` model and reused Moonshine source are
covered by Section 1 (MIT). Section 2 (Moonshine AI Community License
Agreement) applies only to the legacy non-English, non-streaming models
listed upstream; none are included in Transcribro. The upstream license is
preserved in full below and in the listed license files.

- `speech/src/main/cpp/medium/stream.cpp`, `speech/src/main/cpp/medium/text.h`
  and `verification/standalone-runtime/pipeline.py`: adapted from
  `core/transcriber.cpp`, `core/voice-activity-detector.cpp`,
  `core/moonshine-streaming-model.cpp` and `core/bin-tokenizer/bin-tokenizer.cpp`;
  fixed native execution retains the segmentation, preview and finalization
  policy. Local modifications are described in the packaged notice.
- `speech/tools/import_model.py`: adapted model representation; converts the
  eight exact original files from `docs/moonshine-model.json` and the inner
  Silero from `core/silero-vad-model-data.h` into a reversible tensor archive.
- `tools/assets/silero-vad.ort`: the inner Silero VAD model, extracted
  byte-for-byte from the `silero_vad_onnx` array in
  `core/silero-vad-model-data.h` of the pinned Moonshine tree above and
  vendored in-tree (2026-11-10); build input to the model converter,
  excluded from app compilation. Provenance and hashes are recorded in
  `tools/assets/PROVENANCE.md` and in the `vad` section of
  `speech/native-inputs.lock.json`.
- `speech/build/generated/medium-assets/models/standalone/medium.trm.zst`:
  adapted; reversible integer packing and lossless Zstandard compression of
  the original Medium and embedded inner Silero values. The same bytes are
  copied into `app/build/generated/mediumAssets/debug/models/standalone/`,
  `app/build/generated/mediumAssets/staging/models/standalone/` and
  `app/build/generated/mediumAssets/release/models/standalone/`.
- `speech/build/generated/medium-assets/models/standalone/tokenizer.bin`:
  copied unchanged. The same bytes are copied into the three app asset
  directories above. Exact SHA-256 hashes are in `speech/medium-model.json`.
- `docs/moonshine-model.json`: adapted; selects original Medium files and pins
  their sizes and digests from the upstream model release
  `medium-streaming-en/quantized_26_08_21`.
- `verification/standalone-runtime/reference-patches/moonshine-vad-no-overlap.patch`:
  adapted from `core/voice-activity-detector.cpp` and `.h`; reference-only
  completed-segment sample boundaries and bounded look-behind.
- `verification/standalone-runtime/reference-patches/moonshine-final-full-encode.patch`:
  adapted from `core/moonshine-streaming-model.cpp`; reference-only full final
  encoding of retained frontend features.
- `verification/standalone-runtime/reference-patches/moonshine-streaming-token-budget.patch`:
  adapted from `core/transcriber.cpp`, `.h`, `core/moonshine-c-api.cpp` and
  `core/moonshine-streaming-model.cpp`, `.h`; reference-only final/preview budgets.
- `verification/standalone-runtime/reference-patches/moonshine-skip-incomplete-decoding.patch`:
  adapted from `core/moonshine-c-api.h`, `core/transcriber.cpp` and `.h`;
  reference-only per-call suppression of unfinished decoding.
- `verification/standalone-runtime/reference-patches/moonshine-asr-allocation.patch`:
  adapted from `core/ort-utils/ort-utils.cpp`, `.h`, `core/moonshine-model.cpp`,
  `.h` and `core/moonshine-streaming-model.cpp`, `.h`; reference-only ASR arena,
  initializer and decoder prepacking ownership. These five patches retain
  upstream context and use the same pinned MIT source above. They are never
  applied by any app build; the nearby verification licenses accompany them.
- `verification/standalone-runtime/run_stream.cpp`: reference-only use of the
  unchanged `core/moonshine-c-api.h` declarations.
- `speech/src/main/assets/licenses/Moonshine-LICENSE.txt`,
  `speech/src/main/cpp/medium/licenses/Moonshine.txt` and
  `verification/standalone-runtime/licenses/Moonshine.txt`: copied unchanged.
- `speech/src/main/assets/licenses/Moonshine-MODIFICATIONS.txt`: original local
  description of the model representation and adapted streaming policy.

